            "review_text": "Mosaic Images\nHaworth, United Kingdom1193 contributions\n0\nPopeyes The BEST FRIED CHICKEN\nDec 2016 • Friends\nIt is only in Vietnam, I can have this experience, yes it is an unfashionable type of fast food... and I limit myself to one lunch every visit... then I have the works. In the UK there are about 4 outlets.... each on a secure USAF base... really am I going to break into RAF Mildenhall for fried chicken... I think not , so all you KFC fans.... when in Vietnam . seek out POPEYES.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 24, 2017",
